{"seq":3,"slug":"watchlist-hit-correlation","title":"名单命中关联联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/realtime-screening-engine/watchlist-hit-correlation","wordCount":2514,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"名单命中关联联动\">名单命中关联联动</h1><p>制裁名单与监控名单筛查是反洗钱体系里一个特殊的子系统。它的判定逻辑与行为规则完全不同：行为规则依赖统计异常（&quot;这笔交易与这个主体的历史不一致&quot;），而名单筛查依赖<strong>身份匹配</strong>（&quot;这个人是不是名单上的那个人&quot;）。前者可以容忍一定比例的误判，后者则以法律义务的形式要求尽可能不放过任何一个匹配。</p>\n<p>这个差异导致名单筛查在工程上有两个硬约束：<strong>必须在同步路径上执行</strong>（因为放行受制裁对象的后果无法事后弥补），以及<strong>必须能解释为什么匹配</strong>（因为误报会直接冻结正常客户，必须有可申诉的依据）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>名单筛查的输入是交易或客户的身份信息（姓名、证件号、出生日期、地址、国别），输出是一个<strong>匹配分数</strong>及其构成。中间要经过名称规范化、多语言音译、模糊匹配与相似度评分四个步骤。每一步都会引入不确定性，而这些不确定性最终要在&quot;放过&quot;与&quot;误伤&quot;之间做出选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[输入身份信息] --&gt; B[规范化&lt;br/&gt;大小写/变音符号/顺序]&#10;  B --&gt; C[多语言音译&lt;br/&gt;拉丁/西里尔/阿拉伯]&#10;  C --&gt; D[候选检索&lt;br/&gt;倒排/前缀/编辑距离]&#10;  D --&gt; E[相似度评分&lt;br/&gt;名称+证件+出生日期+国别]&#10;  E --&gt; F{分数 vs 双阈值}&#10;  F -- &lt; 低阈值 --&gt; G[通过]&#10;  F -- 低~高 之间 --&gt; H[潜在匹配&lt;br/&gt;异步人工复核]&#10;  F -- &gt; 高阈值 --&gt; I[确认匹配&lt;br/&gt;同步阻断 + 人工]&#10;  H --&gt; J[复核结论回流&lt;br/&gt;调整阈值]&#10;  J --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  A[输入身份信息] --&gt; B[规范化&lt;br/&gt;大小写/变音符号/顺序]\n  B --&gt; C[多语言音译&lt;br/&gt;拉丁/西里尔/阿拉伯]\n  C --&gt; D[候选检索&lt;br/&gt;倒排/前缀/编辑距离]\n  D --&gt; E[相似度评分&lt;br/&gt;名称+证件+出生日期+国别]\n  E --&gt; F{分数 vs 双阈值}\n  F -- &lt; 低阈值 --&gt; G[通过]\n  F -- 低~高 之间 --&gt; H[潜在匹配&lt;br/&gt;异步人工复核]\n  F -- &gt; 高阈值 --&gt; I[确认匹配&lt;br/&gt;同步阻断 + 人工]\n  H --&gt; J[复核结论回流&lt;br/&gt;调整阈值]\n  J --&gt; E</pre><p>图中值得强调的是 <code>复核结论回流</code> 这条边。名单筛查的效果不是靠一次性的算法调优达成的，而是靠持续的<strong>误报标注</strong>——人工复核的每一条&quot;这其实不是同一个人&quot;都在为系统提供训练与校准数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"名称规范化与音译\">名称规范化与音译</h2><h3 id=\"规范化的必要性\">规范化的必要性</h3><p>同一个人的名字在不同系统里可能写作：<code>Mohammed Al-Rashid</code>、<code>MUHAMMAD AL RASHID</code>、<code>Mohammad Al Rashid</code>、<code>Muhammed Alrasheed</code>。规范化的目标是把这些变体映射到尽可能接近的表示，降低后续匹配的负担。</p>\n<p>规范化步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>大小写与空白</strong>：统一大写，多重空格归一。</li>\n<li><strong>变音符号剥离</strong>：<code>é</code> → <code>e</code>，<code>ü</code> → <code>u</code>。但要注意有些语言中变音符号承载语义（瑞典语姓氏），剥离会产生碰撞。</li>\n<li><strong>标点与连接词</strong>：<code>Al-</code>, <code>bin</code>, <code>binti</code>, <code>de</code>, <code>van</code> 等前缀的处理需要按语言分别处理，不能一律删除——删除 <code>bin</code> 会把沙特命名习惯中的父子关系丢掉。</li>\n<li><strong>名字顺序归一</strong>：西方与东亚的姓/名顺序不同，且很多名单不标注顺序。实用的做法是<strong>同时匹配两种顺序并取较高分</strong>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"多语言音译\">多语言音译</h3><p>跨文字系统的匹配是名单筛查最难的部分。阿拉伯语、西里尔语、中文名在转写为拉丁字母时存在多种标准（ISO 233、ALA-LC、BGN/PCGN），同一个名字会产出不同的拉丁形式。</p>\n<p>工程上的处理方式不是选择一种标准，而是<strong>接受多种转写变体作为一个键的多个别名</strong>，在检索时对输入生成候选转写集合，与名单侧的别名集合求交集。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;list_entry_id&quot;: &quot;SAN-2026-00418&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source&quot;: &quot;national_sanctions_list&quot;,&#10;  &quot;primary_name&quot;: &quot;MUHAMMAD AL-RASHID&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aliases&quot;: [&quot;MOHAMMED AL RASHID&quot;, &quot;MUHAMMED ALRASHEED&quot;, &quot;محمد الرشيد&quot;, &quot;穆罕默德·拉希德&quot;],&#10;  &quot;identifiers&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;passport&quot;: [{ &quot;country&quot;: &quot;XX&quot;, &quot;number_partial&quot;: &quot;P****8842&quot; }],&#10;    &quot;dob&quot;: [&quot;1974-03-12&quot;, &quot;1974-03-00&quot;],&#10;    &quot;nationality&quot;: [&quot;XX&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;program&quot;: &quot;asset_freeze&quot;,&#10;  &quot;listed_at&quot;: &quot;2024-11-02&quot;,&#10;  &quot;last_synced_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"list_entry_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SAN-2026-00418\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"national_sanctions_list\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"primary_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MUHAMMAD AL-RASHID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aliases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MOHAMMED AL RASHID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MUHAMMED ALRASHEED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"محمد الرشيد\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"穆罕默德·拉希德\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"identifiers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"passport\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"XX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"number_partial\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P****8842\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1974-03-12\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1974-03-00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"nationality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"XX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"program\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"asset_freeze\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"listed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2024-11-02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"last_synced_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>dob</code> 中的 <code>1974-03-00</code> 是一个代表性细节：名单经常只提供年月或只提供年，因此出生日期匹配必须是<strong>部分匹配</strong>并给予较低权重，而不是精确比较。<code>number_partial</code> 同理——名单常只公布证件号的尾数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"检索的候选生成\">检索的候选生成</h3><p>直接对所有名单条目计算相似度不可行（名单规模可达百万级）。需要先做<strong>候选检索</strong>，把候选集缩到几十条，再精算。</p>\n<p>可用的检索结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>权衡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>倒排索引（token → 条目）</td>\n<td>名称分词后的精确匹配</td>\n<td>快，但拼写变体失配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀索引</td>\n<td>短名称</td>\n<td>对首字母音译差异敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>n-gram 索引（bigram/trigram）</td>\n<td>通用模糊检索</td>\n<td>召回高，候选集较大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编辑距离 BK-tree</td>\n<td>中等规模名单</td>\n<td>精确但扩展性差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量检索（名称嵌入）</td>\n<td>跨语言</td>\n<td>需要标注数据训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中常用组合：先用 n-gram 倒排生成候选，再用加权相似度精算，并对超长名单使用向量检索补充跨语言召回。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相似度评分与阈值\">相似度评分与阈值</h2><h3 id=\"分量的加权\">分量的加权</h3><p>名称相似度只是总分的一个分量。完整评分应综合多个维度，并允许分量缺失（缺失的分量不参与归一化，而不是记为 0 分——记为 0 会系统性压低分数导致漏报）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分量</th>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>缺失处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全名相似度</td>\n<td>归一化编辑距离 + token 集合 Jaccard</td>\n<td>0.55</td>\n<td>不可缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证件号</td>\n<td>精确或尾号匹配</td>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td>缺失则权重重分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出生日期</td>\n<td>精确/年月/仅年 三级匹配</td>\n<td>0.12</td>\n<td>缺失则重分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>国别/国籍</td>\n<td>精确匹配</td>\n<td>0.08</td>\n<td>缺失则重分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def match_score(query, entry):&#10;    parts = []&#10;    parts.append((&quot;name&quot;, name_similarity(query.name, entry.aliases), 0.55))&#10;    if query.id_number and entry.identifiers:&#10;        parts.append((&quot;id&quot;, id_similarity(query.id_number, entry.identifiers), 0.25))&#10;    if query.dob and entry.identifiers.get(&quot;dob&quot;):&#10;        parts.append((&quot;dob&quot;, dob_similarity(query.dob, entry.identifiers[&quot;dob&quot;]), 0.12))&#10;    if query.country:&#10;        parts.append((&quot;country&quot;, country_similarity(query.country, entry.identifiers), 0.08))&#10;&#10;    total_w = sum(w for _, _, w in parts)&#10;    score = sum(v * w for _, v, w in parts) / total_w   # 缺失分量重分配权重&#10;    return score, {k: v for k, v, _ in parts}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> match_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query, entry):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    parts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    parts.append((</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name_similarity(query.name, entry.aliases), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.55</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query.id_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.identifiers:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        parts.append((</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id_similarity(query.id_number, entry.identifiers), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query.dob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.identifiers.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        parts.append((</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dob_similarity(query.dob, entry.identifiers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query.country:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        parts.append((</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, country_similarity(query.country, entry.identifiers), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.08</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, _, w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, v, w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_w   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 缺失分量重分配权重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score, {k: v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k, v, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parts}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>缺失分量重分配权重</code> 是关键设计：一个没有证件号的客户，其名称相似度将承担更大的权重。这提高了这一类客户的分数敏感度，是刻意的取舍——缺少辅助标识本身就应当提高可疑度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"双阈值与灰区\">双阈值与灰区</h3><p>单阈值会导致一个尴尬的局面：阈值调低则误伤大量正常客户，调高则漏掉真实匹配。解决办法是设两个阈值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq \\theta_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：<strong>确认匹配</strong>，同步阻断并立即转人工，处置时限以小时计。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{low} \\leq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; \\theta_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：<strong>潜在匹配</strong>，放行但异步生成复核任务，处置时限以天计。</li>\n<li>分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; \\theta_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：通过，不留任务。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>灰区的宽度决定了人工复核的工作量，这是必须与运营能力匹配的参数。灰区过宽会让复核队列积压，导致真实匹配被延迟处理——延迟处理在制裁筛查里同样构成违规。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四眼原则与复核质量\">四眼原则与复核质量</h3><p>确认匹配的处置不能由单人完成。标准做法是<strong>四眼原则</strong>：一名分析员给出初步结论，另一名独立复核。这一要求的原因是误伤的代价很高（客户资金被冻结、声誉损失），而单一分析员可能因为确认偏误而错误地维持匹配。</p>\n<p>需要监控的复核质量指标包括：复核结论与初始分数的相关性（如果高分区大量被判定为&quot;非同一人&quot;，说明评分模型或名单质量有问题）、复核时长分布（过长说明案件复杂或流程有阻塞）、以及申诉成功率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与交易规则的联动\">与交易规则的联动</h2><h3 id=\"名单命中的两种触发时机\">名单命中的两种触发时机</h3><p>名单筛查在两个时机被触发，两者的处置逻辑不同：</p>\n<p><strong>客户准入时</strong>：新客户开户或首次交易前筛查客户本身及其受益所有人。命中则阻止开户或要求 EDD，这一环节属于客户准入职责，本 hub 只说明其结论（客户风险档）如何影响后续交易监控强度。</p>\n<p><strong>交易发生时</strong>：筛查交易对手方。这一环节是本文的重点，因为对手方信息往往只有名称与国别，噪声远高于自有客户信息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与行为规则的联动\">与行为规则的联动</h3><p>名单命中与行为规则不是并列关系，而是<strong>互相增强</strong>的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个处于灰区的潜在匹配客户，如果在行为规则上也有异常（例如突发大额跨境转账），应当合并升级为高优先级案件，而不是两条独立警报。</li>\n<li>确认匹配的对象，其所有后续交易应自动进入强化监控，不再依赖常规阈值。</li>\n<li>反之，名单筛查的误报标注应当反馈到客户风险评级中——一个被反复标注为&quot;非同一人&quot;的客户，其名单相关的风险贡献应下调。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 名单命中与行为警报的关联升级&#10;SELECT&#10;  l.entity_id,&#10;  l.list_entry_id,&#10;  l.score,&#10;  a.alert_id,&#10;  a.rule_id,&#10;  GREATEST(l.score, a.priority_score) +&#10;    CASE WHEN l.score BETWEEN :theta_low AND :theta_high&#10;              AND a.priority_score &gt; 0.6 THEN 0.15 ELSE 0 END&#10;    AS combined_priority&#10;FROM list_match_pending l&#10;JOIN alert a ON a.entity_id = l.entity_id&#10;WHERE a.created_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;  AND l.score &gt;= :theta_low;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 名单命中与行为警报的关联升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list_entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">alert_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">priority_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :theta_low </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :theta_high</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">priority_score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> combined_priority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list_match_pending l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alert a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :theta_low;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>+ 0.15</code> 这个提升项表达了联动逻辑：灰区名单匹配叠加高优先级行为异常，其联合风险高于两者各自评估的最大值。这个提升量应当是配置项而非硬编码，因为它直接影响案件队列排序。</p>\n<h3 id=\"名单同步与版本留痕\">名单同步与版本留痕</h3><p>名单在持续更新：新增被制裁对象、移除已解除制裁的对象、修正错误条目。系统必须记录<strong>筛查时使用的名单版本</strong>，否则无法回答&quot;当时为什么没有命中&quot;——可能因为该对象在那个时间点尚未被列入。这个字段与 <a href=\"../realtime-screening-engine/transaction-realtime-screen\">实时交易筛查管道</a> 中要求的执行记录一同构成可追溯的基础。</p>\n<p>名单同步的延迟本身是合规风险：如果名单发布到系统生效之间隔了数小时，这段时间内的交易筛查是基于旧名单的。因此同步延迟必须作为监控指标，并设置告警；对于资产冻结类名单，同步应当是分钟级的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>名单筛查依赖身份匹配而非统计异常，因此必须在同步路径上执行，且必须能解释匹配原因。</li>\n<li>名称规范化需按语言分别处理前缀与变音符号；多语言音译应接受多种转写标准作为同一条目的别名集合，而不是选定一种。</li>\n<li>候选检索用 n-gram 倒排加精算，超长名单辅以向量检索；直接全量计算不可行。</li>\n<li>相似度评分需综合名称、证件、出生日期、国别四个分量，缺失分量必须重分配权重而非记零分。</li>\n<li>双阈值加灰区是必须的，灰区宽度要与复核产能匹配；确认匹配处置遵守四眼原则。</li>\n<li>名单命中与行为规则应合并升级而非并列；筛查时必须记录所使用的名单版本，同步延迟是合规风险指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关：名单匹配在管道中的位置与 fail-closed 策略见 <a href=\"../realtime-screening-engine/transaction-realtime-screen\">实时交易筛查管道</a>；灰区命中如何进入案件流程见 <a href=\"../alert-investigation-report/alert-case-workflow\">警报分派与调查案件流</a>；名单风险如何影响客户评级见 <a href=\"../customer-risk-tuning/customer-risk-rating-cdd-edd\">客户风险分级与 CDD/EDD</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"名单命中关联联动","id":"名单命中关联联动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"名称规范化与音译","id":"名称规范化与音译"},{"level":3,"text":"规范化的必要性","id":"规范化的必要性"},{"level":3,"text":"多语言音译","id":"多语言音译"},{"level":3,"text":"检索的候选生成","id":"检索的候选生成"},{"level":2,"text":"相似度评分与阈值","id":"相似度评分与阈值"},{"level":3,"text":"分量的加权","id":"分量的加权"},{"level":3,"text":"双阈值与灰区","id":"双阈值与灰区"},{"level":3,"text":"四眼原则与复核质量","id":"四眼原则与复核质量"},{"level":2,"text":"与交易规则的联动","id":"与交易规则的联动"},{"level":3,"text":"名单命中的两种触发时机","id":"名单命中的两种触发时机"},{"level":3,"text":"与行为规则的联动","id":"与行为规则的联动"},{"level":3,"text":"名单同步与版本留痕","id":"名单同步与版本留痕"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"聚合窗口与对手方网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/realtime-screening-engine/aggregation-window-counterparty"},"next":{"title":"警报分派与调查案件流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/alert-investigation-report/alert-case-workflow"}}